<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Moonstone starts sea diamond mining.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Moonstone starts sea diamond mining.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moonstone Diamond Corp NL said on Thursday it has begun trial mining of diamonds from the sea floor on the west coast of South Africa using a specially-fitted vessel.</p>
<p>Moonstone said it plans to keep the vessel, the Moonstar, at sea for 12 months.</p>
<p>The ship is expected to mine about 65,000 carats of gem-quality diamonds a year, the company said.</p>
<p>Benguela Concessions Ltd of South Africa is a joint venture partner in the project.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 937-1800</p>
